## 🧪 Testing Requirements

### E2E Tests with Playwright

**Test every user-facing feature:**
```typescript
// tests/clients/create-client.spec.ts
import { test, expect } from '@playwright/test';

test.describe('Create Client', () => {
  test.beforeEach(async ({ page }) => {
    // Login as case manager
    await page.goto('/login');
    await page.fill('[name="email"]', 'test-cm@example.com');
    await page.fill('[name="password"]', 'password123');
    await page.click('button[type="submit"]');
    await expect(page).toHaveURL('/case-manager');
  });

  test('should create new client with valid data', async ({ page }) => {
    await page.goto('/case-manager/clients');
    await page.click('[data-testid="add-client-button"]');

    // Fill form
    await page.fill('[name="first_name"]', 'John');
    await page.fill('[name="last_name"]', 'Doe');
    await page.fill('[name="email"]', 'john.doe@example.com');
    await page.fill('[name="phone"]', '555-0123');

    // Submit
    await page.click('button[type="submit"]');

    // Verify success
    await expect(page.locator('text=Client created successfully')).toBeVisible();
    await expect(page.locator('text=John Doe')).toBeVisible();
  });

  test('should show validation errors for missing required fields', async ({ page }) => {
    await page.goto('/case-manager/clients');
    await page.click('[data-testid="add-client-button"]');

    // Try to submit without filling
    await page.click('button[type="submit"]');

    // Verify validation errors
    await expect(page.locator('text=First name is required')).toBeVisible();
  });

  test('should work on mobile viewport', async ({ page }) => {
    await page.setViewportSize({ width: 375, height: 667 });
    await page.goto('/case-manager/clients');
    
    // Mobile-specific tests
    await expect(page.locator('[data-testid="mobile-menu"]')).toBeVisible();
  });
});
```

**Test Coverage Requirements:**
- [ ] Happy path (successful flow)
- [ ] Validation errors
- [ ] Permission checks (try as different roles)
- [ ] Empty states
- [ ] Loading states
- [ ] Error states (network failure, server error)
- [ ] Mobile responsiveness
- [ ] Keyboard navigation

### Manual Testing Checklist

Before marking any feature complete:
- [ ] Test as each user role (case_manager, provider, supervisor, org_admin)
- [ ] Test on mobile (iPhone, Android)
- [ ] Test on tablet (iPad)
- [ ] Test on desktop (Chrome, Firefox, Safari)
- [ ] Test with slow network (throttle in DevTools)
- [ ] Test with screen reader (VoiceOver/NVDA)
- [ ] Test keyboard navigation (no mouse)
- [ ] Test with browser extensions disabled
- [ ] Verify data isolation (create separate org, verify no cross-access)

