## 📝 Documentation Requirements

### Code Comments

**When to add comments:**
```typescript
// ✅ Complex business logic
// Calculate prorated amount based on remaining days in billing cycle
// Formula: (days_remaining / total_days_in_month) * monthly_rate
const proratedAmount = (daysRemaining / totalDays) * monthlyRate;

// ✅ Non-obvious workarounds
// Workaround for Safari bug with date inputs
// See: https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=123456
if (isSafari) {
  // Workaround implementation
}

// ✅ Important side effects
// This will trigger a webhook to external system
// Failure is logged but does not block the operation
await notifyExternalSystem(data);

// ❌ Obvious code (don't comment)
// Set loading to true
setLoading(true);  // No comment needed

// ❌ Outdated comments (worse than no comments)
// TODO: Fix this later (from 2023)
```

### README Files

**When to create/update README:**
- New major feature → Update main README.md
- New component library → Add component-specific README
- New API integration → Document in README-[integration].md
- New testing approach → Update testing documentation

### Migration Comments

**ALWAYS comment database migrations:**
```sql
-- Migration: Add client document management
-- Author: [Your Name]
-- Date: 2025-01-15
-- Description: Adds tables for storing client documents with proper RLS
-- Related PRD: /tasks/0023-prd-client-documents.md

CREATE TABLE public.client_documents (
  -- Primary key and relationships
  id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT uuid_generate_v4(),
  client_id UUID NOT NULL REFERENCES public.clients(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,
  
  -- Document metadata
  file_name TEXT NOT NULL,
  file_size INTEGER NOT NULL,
  file_type TEXT NOT NULL,
  storage_path TEXT NOT NULL,
  
  -- Standard columns
  organization_id UUID NOT NULL REFERENCES public.organizations(id),
  created_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT NOW() NOT NULL,
  created_by UUID REFERENCES auth.users(id),
  deleted_at TIMESTAMPTZ
);

-- Index for performance
CREATE INDEX idx_client_documents_client_id ON public.client_documents(client_id)
  WHERE deleted_at IS NULL;

-- Enable RLS
ALTER TABLE public.client_documents ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY;

-- RLS Policies
CREATE POLICY "org_members_select_documents" 
  ON public.client_documents FOR SELECT
  USING (
    organization_id IN (
      SELECT organization_id FROM public.user_profiles 
      WHERE user_id = auth.uid()
    )
    AND deleted_at IS NULL
  );
```

