└── [config files only]

Application Code (src/):
├── app/api/[resource]/route.ts          # API routes
├── app/[role]/[page]/page.tsx           # Pages
├── components/[category]/[Component].tsx # React components
├── lib/actions/[resource]-actions.ts    # Server actions
├── lib/utils/[util].ts                  # Utilities
